  "title": "Sugar Prices Surge Amid Ethanol and Cane Output Concerns",
  "summary": "India's sugar prices have risen sharply due to ethanol production and declining sugarcane output, with experts attributing the increase to supply shortages and industry practices, though the exact cause remains unclear. The government has rejected claims of ethanol diversion, while opposition parties argue the policy is pushing up prices.",
